{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, explore, and progress at your own pace in this pixel art city builder;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage over 20 resources gathered from your towns, spread across an endless, randomly generated map;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets of our past, and prepare for what may come...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless world \u2013 freely explore and expand without limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build and manage \u2013 plan your settlements, build as many as you want and optimize your resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Light planning challenge \u2013 thoughtful placement and resource management add a gentle puzzle element.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art &amp; cozy vibe \u2013 a relaxing, family-friendly experience perfect for anyone who enjoys slow-paced creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LORE: After many generations of life in shelters, the world has healed and is ready to take us back. Humanity is once again venturing into the wilds, driven by a desire to reclaim and surpass the scientific knowledge of their ancestors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: &quot;Tavern Loop One&quot; \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer: Alexander Nakarada \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Source:  \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026060?t=1769188625","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026060?t=1769188625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026060/20d322cf8ba554d1727e41e772f4e